Cat Clip Composer 0.1.28

- Returns cancelled Project Preview overlay transforms to their exact stored state.
- Shows current prerender intervals in green and changed intervals in yellow.
- Coalesces and retries rapid cached-preview source switches before reporting playback failure.
- Adds new image overlays at the playhead when no selected video range supplies timing.
- Adds timed GIF/video overlays with transform, opacity, fades, locking, and looping motion.
